@plantuml/core 1.2026.6
https://github.com/plantuml/plantuml/tree/6287b33c5d1be2f7b0d480687d0b5a1accbd7971

The PlantUML-family Worker vendors plantuml.js and viz-global.js from the
official @plantuml/core 1.2026.6 package. The package tarball integrity is:

sha512-e+s8jtAKT6kb7yvOCXv0exXOp7FvyKYDcpv+aQrThwXUQgdTGP+fb9hPZQr7jbeEMuUHbxjH1HYLwNZZxw3hJg==

viz-global.js is mechanically adapted to accept a Cloudflare CompiledWasm
module instead of compiling its embedded bytes during a request, and its
Node-only `__filename` URL fallback is replaced with a fixed inert URL. The
extracted GraphViz module reports GraphViz 14.1.1. GraphViz is licensed under EPL-2.0;
the repository's shared EPL-2.0 text is included at
licenses/bytefield-license.txt.

Corresponding source for the embedded GraphViz version is available at
https://gitlab.com/graphviz/graphviz/-/tree/14.1.1. DiagramZip's adapted
wrapper and Wasm import bridge are retained beside this artifact.

